window.products.push({"id":568058,"name":"MUZUO Fire Hydrant Steam Diverter Release Accessories for Instant Pot IP Duo/Duo Plus/Ultra/Viva/Nova/Smart Only","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Z4iPLyDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【CABINET SAVIOR】---The fire hydrant pressure cooker steam release diverter's specifically designed to safely divert steam to the side instead of up into your cabinets and cupboards. Our fire hydrant-shaped steam diverter for instant pot keeps your kitchen mess free and clean. It prevents moisture that may harm or cause molds on your wooden cabinets. No need to move your pressure cooker away from cabinet again when you release the pressure. ✔【BROAD COMPATIBILITY】--- This MUZUO fire hydrant steam diverter release accessories compatible with Instant Pot pressure cooker for Duo, Duo Plus and Ultra for 3, 6, and 8 Quart; Smart WiFi, Smart Bluetooth , Duo Nova and Nova Plus for 6 Quart; Viva for 6 and 8 Quart models. ✔【EASY TO USE AND CLEAN】--- You could just install the silicone steam diverter for instant pot in seconds - Simply snap the steam diverter silicone pressure release accessory on your pressure cooker steam release valve before cooking. Then rotate it the diverter hose to the direction you want for pressure and steam release.Next turn steam release valve to the venting position after your tasty food is complete. At last,clean it with detergent water or put it in the dishwasher to clean it. ✔【UPGRADE VERSION DESIGN】--- Our upgraded fire hydrant steam release diverter accessory for instant pot won't press the valve and can make it work normally. The one vent on each side design keep the steam go fast and better to release steam than other items having only one vent. The symmetrical two vents design make it easy to keep balance and seal,so it can stand up straight and doesn't lean. What's more,Its unique fire hydrant shape looks vivid and cute. ✔【FOOD GRADE SILICONE MATERIAL】---This fire hydrant steam diverter pressure release accessories for Instant Pot pressure cooker made of 100% food grade silicone. It's BPA-Free and heat resistant that provide the most safe steam release. It stands straight up on the steam release valve with stability. Never worry about leaking or leaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Z4iPLyDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUZUO","source_asin":"B07ZZZLCXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZZZLCXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZZZLCXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
