window.products.push({"id":568091,"name":"Xducom 2 Pcs Coffee Scoop, 18/8 Stainless Steel Coffee Tablespoon Measuring Spoons, 2 Tablespoon Coffee Scoop for Ground Coffee,Tea(Multicolor)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wXo0VSCwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality：Our coffee scoop is made of food grade 18/8 stainless steel and is formed in one piece，no nasty chemicals like with plastic coffee measuring spoons. Coffee spoons are stainless steel so dishwasher safe. EASY TO USE AND STORE：2 tablespoon scoop comes with a short handle, lightweight and small enough to store in the Airscape container,also great for coffee canisters,sugar canisters, flour canisters,tea canisters. With US & metric measurement engraved on handle,So many recipes call for 2 Tbsp scoop,it saves time and other messy utensils. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: Sleekly and uniquely designed, Coffee scoop for ground coffee has curves and indentations that make it easy to hold and a pleasure to use, Its short but ergonomic handle allows this without sacrificing utility. Easy TO CLEAN: Easy to clean and with stainless steel does not hold onto one coffee smell, Coffee measuring spoon wash up nicely in the dishwasher MULTIPURPOSE：2 tablespoon(1/8 cup) coffee scoop is not only coffee, but also used for scooping sugar, flour, corn starch, milk powder, bath salt, sour cream, peanut butter, jelly, sauces, creamer, quinoa, Cheerios, goldfish and other items. Sturdy,practical and small scoop is very suitable for your daily life, and also make a great gift for a wedding, birthday, family,friends, housewarming or the coffee enthusiasts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wXo0VSCwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xducom","source_asin":"B09HTLCDPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568091","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HTLCDPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HTLCDPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":568092,"name":"World's Fair by Yale Gurney, 22x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ia3HR5nxL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a giant metal globe. Having spent time working in the ad, marketing and PR worlds, Yale Gurney has a keen knowledge of storytelling, now through his camera's eye. Yale frequently travels on assignment to document events, creat production stills and develop photographic stories for wall decor furnishings for an array of clients from hotels and businesses to private clients. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ia3HR5nxL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D0ZAHMI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D0ZAHMI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D0ZAHMI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":568093,"name":"Amish Wares 32 Inch Rustic Hunter Green Barn Star Made with Galvanized Metal to Prevent Rusting. American Handcrafted - Made in The USA!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614di6FFE2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"32 Inch Rustic Hunter Green Barn Star Made with Galvanized Metal to Prevent Rusting. Amish Hand Made Your Source for Heavy Duty Metal Tin Barn Stars and Primitive Style Stars for Your Country Crafts and Home and Garden Decor. American Handcrafted - Made in the Usa! Heavy duty 22 gauge handcrafted galvanized metal tin barn star, painted barn red in solid paint coverage. Our barn stars are made for outdoor use (no rust will run down the side of your building!) but are perfect for indoor use as well. Painted stars begin with an industrial coat of primer and are topped with a couple coats of severe weather exterior paint. All barn stars in 10 inch, 16 inch and 24 inch are spot welded together. Sizes 32 inch, 40 inch, 53 inch, 72 inch, 96 inch and 120 inch require quick and easy assembly; they arrive in 5 separate wings - simply lay the wings on top of each other and insert the provided screws into the holes and attach the nuts on the back. Hanging brackets are spot welded on the back of the top tip of the 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 10, 16, 24, 32, 40, 53 and 72 inch stars for easy hanging. We highly recommend drilling holes in the tips of the 72, 96, and 120 inch stars for attachment onto a surface. Please note that the 3, 4, 5, 6, and 7 inch stars are 22 gauge steel and are not galvanized metal at this time but will soon be offered in galvanized. The back of those sized stars will arrive as bare steel and are susceptible to rusting. We recommend spraying a clear coat (readily available in a Wal-Mart store for about $1) on the back to keep them from rusting and running down the side of your building. Shipping time is about 5 or 6 days because each star is painted at the time of order. It needs a few days to cure so you will get a quality star. Colors viewed on different computer moniters may distort exact shade of color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614di6FFE2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amish Wares","source_asin":"B00AXNI9Z2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXNI9Z2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXNI9Z2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
