window.products.push({"id":568163,"name":"Double Sided Hanger Hooks Space Saver - 20 PCS Clothes Hanger Connector Hooks - Premium Cascading Hooks Extender Clips, Heavy Duty Space Saving for Cl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C25vn-D+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create More Closet Space: The All New Double-Sided Hanger Hooks - Unlike Hanger Hooks that can only be hung on one side. The All New hanger hooks can be Double-sided vertically hang items, which can increase the available storage space in your wardrobe by at least three times. Plus, a cramped closet means wrinkled clothes — not anymore! Wardrobe Reorganizing: Cramped, cluttered closets make it impossible to find what you need. These hanger connectors are very useful for your wardrobe, you can see clearly that the clothes are placed in an orderly arrangement when you open the wardrobe, and find the clothes you need very quickly, which will save you much more time. Have It Now: The package includes 20 PCS, which can store 28 pieces of clothing. The hanger extension hooks are made of high-quality premium ABS material, durable for all types of clothes, these hanger attachment hooks have a strong weight-bearing function to maintain good balance. Unlike flimsy hangers that can only hold lightweight clothing like shirts. Suitable for All Types of Hangers: Use hanger hooks with all types of hangers — Plastic hangers, Stainless steel hangers, Wooden suit hangers and Velvet hangers, etc. Have it now! You will not be disturbed by a messy wardrobe anymore. Easy to Use: Simply slide a hanger hook over your hanger and you’re ready to start organizing your closet! Yecuip hanger connector hooks hold on snuggly to the hanger. Perfect Match: They can not only be used to organize clothes but also can be used to hang belts, bags, Ties, necklaces, and other gadgets. You’ll go from messy to marvelous in seconds. VALUE PACK: You will get 20 PCS of hanger hooks, 4 PCS of double-sided hanger hooks, and 16 PCS of single-sided hanger hooks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C25vn-D+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yecuip","source_asin":"B0BYD7XJX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYD7XJX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYD7XJX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
