window.products.push({"id":568220,"name":"Classic Brands Winterhaven Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support, Full, Linen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uy-GhlwKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add elegance and style to your bedroom with the timeless Winterhaven Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support . This bed features a scalloped upholstered headboard with diamond stitching and button-tufted fabric that is soft to the touch. The sturdy and durable wood slat and center support system can be used for any mattress size or type; no box-spring required. The Winterhaven is constructed from plywood and hardwood and is crafted with enduring craftsmanship. The low-profile bed frame is supported by 8-inch solid wood legs and the headboard makes a lovely backdrop of a little over 4-feet tall. Available in both grey and linen Combine our DeCoro Winterhaven Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support with your memory foam, latex, or innerspring mattress to add unparalleled support. It will extend the longevity of your mattress by properly supporting your mattress, and ultimately preventing it from sagging. The slats are specifically designed to be spaced evenly across the top of the platform to form a solid base for your mattress, insuring even weight distribution throughout. The sturdy center support system is a must have for today’s heavier mattresses and is not typically found in other platform beds and is what really differentiates our bed frame from others. Benefits of the DeCoro Winterhaven Upholstered Platform Bed DeCoro Winterhaven Upholstered Platform Bed is a decorative way to give your mattress some extra support. The headboard, foundation, and frame are an all in one solution and is an excellent choice as a fashionable alternative to a traditional box spring and frame. You’ll love the way this headboard makes a beautiful statement in your bedroom. Features of the DeCoro Winterhaven Upholstered Platform Bed With classic styling, the DeCoro Winterhaven Upholstered Platform Bed is perfect for traditional bedrooms but can be a unique twist to a contemporary setting as well. Not only is the platform bed well-built and durable, it’s beautiful inset soft button-tufted diamond stitching scalloped headboard offers exceptional style and taste. The headboard reaches a height of a little over 4 feet high which instantly makes it the primary focus of your bedroom. The upholstered fabric is soft to the touch and the platform bed is available in either grey or linen and is now available in full, queen, or king sizes. Easy Assembly The DeCoro Upholstered Headboard Platform Bed is easy to assemble; it can be put together in less than an hour. All parts, tools, and instructions are neatly packed in a zippered compartment in the back of the headboard. Just unpack, assemble the frame and attach the hardware and you are ready to place your mattress (and foundation if you please) on top. It is recommended that the upholstered bed frame should be assembled in the room that it is intended for use: •Step 1- Take all components out of the box and position them on the floor •Step 2- Attach the legs to the bottom of the headboard and to the bottom of the footboard •Step 3- Assemble the left side rails to the center horizontal support rail. Assemble the right-side rails to the center horizontal support rail.  •Step 4- Attach the headboard to the assembled side rails •Step 5- Attach the footboard to the assembled side rails •Step 6- Attach the center support rails to the middle of assembled bed •Step 7- Attach the horizontal center support rail to the middle of the assembled bed •Step 8- Attach the wood slats •Step 7- Place your mattress on top and enjoy! Get it Right the First Time It is also a good idea to check the size and the height of your mattress to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of the frame, foundation (if you are adding one), and the mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your bed will be. Also note, because of the solid construction of this platform bed, it is recommended that two people lift and assemble the bed. Total weight should not exceed 700 lbs. including the mattress. • Full Size - 60\" W x 84\" L x 52\" H x 91 lbs • Queen Size - 66\" W x 88\" L x 52\" H x 97 lbs • King Size - 82\" W x 88\" L x 52\" H x 119 lbs Quality Assurance DeCoro Upholstered Platform Bed | Headboard and Metal Frame with Wood Slat Support is backed with a 3-year worry-free warranty. DeCoro carries a wide variety of upholstered platform bed frames in an assortment of designs to match your unique taste and style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uy-GhlwKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B077PD4BHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077PD4BHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077PD4BHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
