window.products.push({"id":568452,"name":"Home Revolution Replacement HEPA Filter, fits Eureka 5700 and 5800 series, Eureka Bagless Vacuum Cleaners, Eureka Litespeed Whirlwind Bagless & SC5845","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pI-+XmDNL._AC_.jpg","description":"Home Revolution Brand provides High-Quality Replacement HEPA Filters for your Eureka Vacuum Cleaner.Made to Fit the following models: Eureka DCF-3 Series. Compare to Part # 1825, 62136, 62136A, DCF3. This is not an OEM product and is not covered under any OEM warranty. The brand names and logos referenced here are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of these brand names, models or part number designations for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. This is a replacement product carefully crafted by Home Revolution. Home Revolution filters detoxify the air and exhilarate the home and mind. With a powerful style of manufacturing, we link clean air and earth-friendly intention together. 100% fresh air and satisfaction or your money back! This is a replacement product carefully crafted, a HOMEREV (TM) Brand. BENEFITS TO REPLACING YOUR VACUUM FILTER HEALTH: Dirty filters can impact respiratory health long-term. HEALTH: Dirty filters can impact respiratory health long-term. ENERGY & EFFICIENCY: A dirty filter causes the unit to work harder to do its job. ENERGY & EFFICIENCY: A dirty filter causes the unit to work harder to do its job. EXPERT TIP: Energy Star recommends changing your filter a minimum of every three months, with the ideal being every monthﾗespecially in the wintertime. EXPERT TIP: Energy Star recommends changing your filter a minimum of every three months, with the ideal being every monthﾗespecially in the wintertime. You want a high-quality , low-cost air filter that removes particles, resists airflow and improves the expected life of your HVAC, refrigerator, air purifier, humidifier, furnace or car.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pI-+XmDNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Revolution","source_asin":"B00MI60H34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MI60H34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MI60H34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":568453,"name":"3 Inch Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper Twin XL, CertiPur-US Approved Twin Extra Long Size Memory Foam Mattress Topper, Comfortable, Medium Soft Topper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WdwYaM7gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MADE IN THE USA. Looking for a better nights rest? Tired of your old worn out mattress causing you to toss and turn? Want to add comfort without the expense of a brand new mattress? We know the feeling. That's why we developed a gel infused memory foam mattress topper so comfortable, you'll forget you ever had sleeping issues in the first place. Our memory foam gel topper ships in a box directly to your door eliminating the need to deal with the hassle of crowded stores and pushy sales people. Our toppers are 100% made in the USA using eco-friendly materials designed to provide you with years of superior sleep comfort. THE PERFECT SLEEP TEMPERATURE. Traditional toppers have a bad reputation for holding body heat. We all like to sleep in a warm and cozy bed, but too much trapped body heat can make you very uncomfortable. Our innovative gel technology features an open cell structure design that sleeps cooler than a regular memory foam topper, minimizes stiffness, improves air flow and dissipates unnecessary heat providing you with the perfect mixture of warmth & cool comfort. SUPPORT. Our unique blend of memory foam gel offers just the right amount of support. Relieve pressure points & revitalize your muscles, joints and spine alignment with our anti sinking design. Enjoy a peaceful night's sleep with minimal disturbance from tossing & turning significant others, kids, or pets. Our memory foam support design absorbs movement providing anyone or anything in your bed the perfect amount of support & softness. WARRANTY AND MONEY BACK GUARANTEE. Made in the USA, we stand by the quality of our products. We offer a 60 Day Money Back Comfortably Perfect Guarantee & a 3 Year Manufacturers Warranty. If you have a problem or want to provide us with feedback, feel free to reach out & connect with us. We're here to help you do one thing, experience a better night's sleep!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WdwYaM7gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Advanced Sleep Solutions","source_asin":"B07QF4TWCD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QF4TWCD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QF4TWCD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
