window.products.push({"id":568653,"name":"YMHPRIDE 60Pcs Satin Chair Sashes Ties Bows for Wedding Reception Chair Decorative Satin Sashes Bow Dining Chair Cover Sashes for Wedding Events Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S3UzuoalL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎵SATIN CHAIR SASHES SET - 60Pcs royal blue satin chair sashes bows for wedding reception, without chair covers, great value chair sashes set, enough to entertain guests. Flat Packing, you can DIY the style you want, not just bows. Dimensions: About 7\" x 108\" (17x275 cm), fully applicable length, perfect chair decorations for party, wedding. 🎵HIGH - QUALITY SATIN - This Chair Sash is made of high quality stain fabric, soft and glossy, the tail sags naturally, not easy to fade, not shrink, reusable. Can be ironed to make it flatter and smoother. These one-piece designs feature a firm sewn, durable, which is a necessity for hosting important events. 🎵EASY TO USE - Satin Chair Cover Bow Sash can fully meet your needs of different styles, you can choose to tie into the most classic bow style, or The Angel Side Bow, The Square Knot, The Kimono, The Rosette, The Weave, etc. You can choose different tie methods according to the scene you use, or your preference. Elegant and glossy wedding chair belt adds a lot sophistication to any formal occasion. 🎵APPLICABLE OCCASIONS - Great for Parties, Graduations, Birthdays, Weddings, Banquets, Engagements, Bar Mitzvahand and other event chair decorations, Suitable for Folding Chairs, Bamboo Chairs and Wooden Chairs. Decorative satin sashes bow can also be used for handicrafts, you can give full play to your imagination, DIY into Table Runners, Bow Hairpins, Bag Straps, Room Decoration, Bottle Decoration, etc. 🎵MORE DETAILS - Specially dyed with a non-fading dye to keep its vibrant original hue long lasting. Hand wash recommended, hang to dry, easy to keep flat. we will be responsible for our product quality, and We promise that all detailed pictures are taken in kind, but due to different monitors and color vision, there may be some color difference. Don't worry, we will provide a satisfactory solution to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S3UzuoalL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YMHPRIDE","source_asin":"B0B58J7ZSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B58J7ZSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B58J7ZSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
