window.products.push({"id":568675,"name":"RainbowPana 50 Individual Pack Biodegradable Wedding Confetti - Dried Flower Petals - Colorful Mix Petals (Rose/Jasmine/Forget-Me-Not) - Wedding Confe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bWrrIlN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CAPTURE THE MAGICAL, INSTAGRAM-WORTHY MOMENTS WITH BEAUTIFUL RAINBOWPANA PRE-PACKAGED DRIED FLOWER CONFETTI: One of the most cherished traditions at weddings is the joyful throwing of confetti or flower petals to celebrate the newlyweds. With our all-natural, eco-friendly dried flower confetti, you can add a burst of color to your Wedding Album, TikTok, Facebook and Instagram feed. Every picture tells a story, let yours be vibrant, joyful, and eco-friendly. HANDPICKED NATURAL DRIED FLOWER CONFETTI - Eco-Friendly Elegance - Biodegradable and Beautiful: RainbowPana Wedding Confetti is crafted from a stunning blend of real Rose Petals, Jasmine Buds & Forget-Me-Not Petals. Each petal is handpicked and naturally dried to preserve its beauty. Completely biodegradable, making it a perfect choice for churches, wedding venues, and any outdoor celebrations. Many venues only allow the use of real petals or biodegradable materials. PACKAGE AND SIZE of RainbowPana Wedding Confetti: Comes in a set of 50 individual packs. Each pack, measuring 3.2 x 4 inches, is filled with enough flower confetti for 1-2 handfuls. Designed for convenience, these easy-to-open packets are individually packaged and ready for each guest to shower the happy couple with a rainbow of petals. Biodegradable Confetti, real luck charm for the bride and groom. AMAZING WEDDING SEND-OFF IDEAS - REAL FLOWER PETALS FOR WEDDING CONFETTI: What could be more enchanting than flower girls scattering flower petal confetti? The moment these petals are tossed in the air at a wedding, the entire atmosphere lights up. They are not just ideal for the grand wedding exit or toss, but also make for beautiful ceremony or reception decorations. Celebrate with the perfect confetti shot! STORAGE: To maintain their vibrant colors and freshness, our petals can be stored for months if kept away from direct sunlight and moisture, in a cool and dry place. To minimize the risk of color fade, we generally recommend purchasing your confetti 1-2 months in advance of your event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bWrrIlN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rainbow Pana","source_asin":"B0BTN8R8GM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTN8R8GM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTN8R8GM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":568676,"name":"RFAQK 35PCs Cake Turntable and Leveler-Rotating Cake Stand with Non Slip pad-7 Icing Tips and 20 Bags- Straight & Offset Spatula-3 Scraper Set -EBook-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uPUk8IN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ COMPLETE CAKE DECORATING TOOLS: ONLY cake tools set including everything you need to start decorating Cakes like a PRO! ✔11 Inch Cake Turntable for decorating ✔7 Random Icing Tips ✔11 Inch Straight and Angled Icing Spatula ✔cake leveler & Slicer✔20 Disposable Bags ✔3 Cake Scrapers Icing Smoother Set eBook User Guide for beginners. ✅ SMOOTH REVOLVING TURNTABLE WITH NON SLIP BASE: Cake Decorating Turntable is made from non-sticky, non-toxic & dishwasher safe plastic. It rotates smoothly with hidden ball bearings on both clock & anti clock wise directions, good for both Right & Left handers. Non-skid silicone ring is present at the bottom of turntable which provides an excellent stability on countertops, preventing cake rotating turntable sliding from workspace. Ideal for beginners as well as for professionals. ✅ CAKE DECORATING TIPS AND BAGS: We have selected professional piping bags and tips set so you can take your cake decoration to next level. Use straight cake spatula for icing round cakes from Sides and angled spatula from Top while rotating cake turntable. Cake leveler (Cutter) slices and levels cakes into even layers for creating professional-looking layer cakes at home. Smooth the cake icing on sides & top and carve designs by using cake icing tools. ✅ EBOOK USER GUIDE FOR BEGINNERS: This cake supplies comes with an EBook User guide by mail includes 3 cake recipes, Method of Cake Baking, Leveling & icing cakes. 3 frosting recipes, Step by step guide for using cake turntable, spatuals, scrapper set, cake leveler and icing tips. ✅ 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Your satisfaction is what drives us to provide the highest quality products. If at any time you are not completely satisfied with your purchase feel free to return it to us for a full and prompt refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uPUk8IN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RFAQK","source_asin":"B0C433P6PX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C433P6PX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C433P6PX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
