window.products.push({"id":568788,"name":"Mini Plant Humidifier, Indoor Cool Mist Humidifier with 10 Cotton Filter Sticks, Portable Desktop Humidifier with Night Light, Auto Shut-Off, Quiet Sm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XGiHiNnBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for cool mist humidifier for plants in your home? Is your skin peeling because of air dryness? Now, buy a portable desktop humidifier! Our Plant Humidifier can give fresh moisturizing environment for indoor plants. From now on, we will have a fresh and moist living space. Specification: Color: Grey/ Blue/ Pink/ WhiteWater capacity: 500mlProduct weight: 236gProduct size: 95*95*129mmInput voltage: DC 5.0VPower Rating: 1.25 - 2WMaterial: ABS/PP/PC/Silicone/Hardware/Electronic parts Package Includes Plant Humidifier Indoor*1pcCable*1pcInstruction manual*1pcCotton filter*10pcQualified Certificate*1pc HOW TO USE: Night lamp function -Long press the mist button 1st time, the LED light will be on(warm light).-Long press the mist button 2nd time, the LED light will be on(breathing light).-Long press the mist button 3rd time, the LED light will be off. Cotton filter replacement -Pull out the cotton filter for replacement.-Before replacing the cotton filter, please soak the cotton filter completely and then put it into the humidifier.-Please pay attention to the bottom spring when replacing. Warmly Note: 1. Please add water before using this product. Humidifying function is prohibited in case of water shortage.2. This product can not add any essential oil or perfume to avoid oily clogging of the transducer.3. Please do not apply water on the machine directly, in case of short-circuit of the machine, please use soft cotton to wipe.4. humidifier is not suitable for working with fast charging which over (5V/1A) . The packaging box may be damaged during transportation. If you have any questions, please contact us in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XGiHiNnBL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funland","source_asin":"B09LHTZSMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LHTZSMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LHTZSMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
