window.products.push({"id":568931,"name":"Refrigerator Liners Washable Refrigerator Mats, Shelf Liners Non-Slip Fridge Pads 88.58 x 11.81 Inch (Roll) & 17.71 x 11.81 Inch (Pc) for Drawer Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711W69oDI-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[RELIABLE SAFE MATERIAL FOR THE USAGE]: The refrigerator liners are made of food-grade EVA material that features BPA-free and odorless so that it can directly contact vegetables and fruits. What's more, it is waterproof to deter water penetration on the refrigerator shelf. And it is easy to move or replace because it is non-adhesive. A shelf liner is reusable and can be placed back in the fridge when it’s dry. [ANTI-SLIP DESIGN OFFERS A SECURITY FOR YOUR ITEMS]: Still worry about slipping and sliding when items are placed on top? The refrigerator mat is your great choice. It is designed with dots texture on one side that has a non-slip, grip bottom so that it can effectively prevent the items from sliding. If you put it on the desk and it can also protect the desktop from being scratched as well as protect the lower shelves from spills and dust. [EASY TO CUT THE SIZE YOU WANT]: The package including 1 roll fridge liner size: 225x30cm/ 88.58*11.81 IN （can be cut 5 pieces 45x30cm/ 17.71*11.81 IN）and 3 colorful single piece 45x30cm/ 17.71*11.81 IN. It's thin enough to make it easier for you to cut and make it stay flat. Simply with a scissor and then place the drawer mat down in the drawer or refrigerator shelf and trim off any excess material. Just remember to measure the space first. [MULTI-FUNCTIONAL TO USE AND WASHABLE]: No more mess refrigerator shelf! Cleaning the fridge mats is easier than the shelf, isn’t it? Just rinsing under the water or cleaned with soap and a damp cloth or sponge. The refrigerator liner is more than a refrigerator mat and could be a shelf liner, cabinet liner, coasters, dining mat, cupboard pad, desk liner, table mat. The kitchen shelf liner can be widely applied in any space of your home. [EXTRA ADHESIVE STICKERS AND AFTER-SALE SERVICE]: There extra 3 pieces of adhesive for better adhesion. Just stick the four corners with these double-sided adhesives. If you fond the wire shelf liner roll up please use a hairdryer to unravel the edges then it would stay flat. Lining your drawers and shelves protects their surfaces from damage and makes cleanup a breeze. If there is any problem, please do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711W69oDI-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"badiJum","source_asin":"B093H7Z42G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-568931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093H7Z42G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093H7Z42G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
