window.products.push({"id":569001,"name":"Hypnotic Gems Materials: 1 lb Beautiful South American 12 Stone Rough Mix - Premium Grade Colorful Mix - Natural Raw Stones for Cabbing, Tumbling, Lap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UYbz2gUYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The original Hypnotic Gems brand of natural stones from South America contains only the finest quality high energy rough from specific mines. We take thousands of pounds of material and combine it together in our factory to create this spectacular mix with 12 different types of beautiful stones.In this mix you will find: Amethyst, Fuschite, Snow Quartz, Sodalite, Rose Quartz, Orange Calcite, Red Jasper, Blue Quartz, Citrine, Green Aventurine, Clear Quartz, and MORE!When Hypnotic Gems makes this assortment it is mixed using more than 1,000 pounds of the assorted materials at a time. This is then poured into giant barrels, and then put into the proper size bags to fill your order of 1 pound, 2 pounds, 3 pounds or 5 pounds which are offered here on Amazon. Because of it being mixed in bulk and then put into bags, the quantity of each stone type in a bag will vary.Please note that every piece of material is unique and your order will contain a variety of sizes, shapes and color shades as shown in our images. You are receiving these stones in the rough just like they came out of the ground. The stones in our images were rinsed then photographed while still wet to show their natural beauty. This South American stone mix, along with all the Hypnotic Gems rough stone mixes on Amazon, are guaranteed to contain a strong positive energy that can only be found in the Hypnotic Gems brand of stones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UYbz2gUYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hypnotic Gems","source_asin":"B00DFBNUX0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DFBNUX0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DFBNUX0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
